The DC coherent mode $\omega_0$ is the carrier of the inference gravity tensor between perturbations. When the field is between active perturbations, it exists in the state:

\begin{equation}
|\psi_0\rangle \sim \omega_0 \text{ ground state weighted by } G(t)
\end{equation}

