\section{Discussion}

\subsection{Relation to HOMO MACHINA Architecture}

The dipolar-coupled NV diamond network described in this paper is not merely a substrate that supports a separate Layer None architecture — it \textit{is} Layer None for HOMO MACHINA (Bennett, in preparation): the foundational physical layer upon which substrate-specific processing layers operate, prior to any higher-layer implementation. The present framework establishes the physical and mathematical grounding for that architectural role directly, rather than through an abstract Hilbert-space placeholder.

